        "seam_note": null
      }
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "words": 38,
      "text": "The second: This soul that comes into him in the administration of his food, day by day; it shall be made holy, cleansed, purified, and washed from the adulteration of the darkness that is mixed in with it.",
