      }
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "words": 47,
      "text": "The third: That person shall make every deed a holy one; the mystery of [the children] of light in whom there is neither corruption nor [...] the food, nor wound it. Rather, they are holy, [there is nothing] in them that defiles, as they live in peace.",
